Verbatim scratch record `.lares-scratch/research/w10-knock/sol/own-wave1.md` (research, file date 2026-10-26); only Markdown transliterated to memetic-wikitext, its words kept as written. Index: [[workshop index|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/workshop/research/w10-knock/sol/index]].

